			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Localize IPC dispatch macro and notify Cocoon on Sky saves\n\nMove the `call!` macro definition from the module level into the `mountain_ipc_invoke` function in `WindServiceHandlers/mod.rs` to capture `RunTime` and `ApplicationHandle` via closure hygiene, avoiding external dependencies and enforcing strict scope.\n\nSimplify `TraceStep` in `TraceLog.rs` by removing unnecessary blank lines. Update `CustomEditorProvider`, `TestProvider`, and `StatusBarProvider` to explicitly import `tauri::Manager` alongside `Emitter` for future context access.\n\nEnhance the `proxy_cocoon` utility to map IPC errors to strings for cleaner propagation. In `Workspace.rs`, refactor the Sky save handling to capture the result and immediately notify the Cocoon extension host via `$acceptModelSaved`. This ensures extensions relying on `onDidSaveTextDocument` trigger correctly for saves initiated by the UI layer.",
			"SHA": "56cd4ccb60cd2047bea5f38d2ba58cff67d5e32f"
